            {
              "id": "c1114ad",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Making the imbalances in the global system visible",
                "header_size": "h2",
                "align": "left",
                "title_color": "#1B4332",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Inria Serif",
                "typography_font_weight": "600",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 32,
                  "sizes": []
                },
                "typography_line_height": {
                  "unit": "em",
                  "size": 1.25,
                  "sizes": []
                }
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "heading"
            },
            {
              "id": "ac9d4d1",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "space": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 20,
                  "sizes": []
                }
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "spacer"
            },
            {
              "id": "7e0fcc2",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The rules shaping our world do not always serve it equally. From conflict and unequal trade to debt, climate and access to technology, many global challenges reflect deeper imbalances in power and whose interests shape international decisions.</p>",
                "text_color": "#2A3B32",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Manrope",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 17,
                  "sizes": []
                },
                "typography_line_height": {
                  "unit": "em",
                  "size": 1.72,
                  "sizes": []
                },
                "align": "left"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
            },
            {
              "id": "ad5a5ce",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "space": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 18,
                  "sizes": []
                }
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "spacer"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3ee4a0",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The conference creates space to bring these inequalities into the light and ask what a fairer international order could look like.</p>",
                "text_color": "#2A3B32",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Manrope",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 17,
                  "sizes": []
                },
                "typography_line_height": {
