              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"font-family:'Inria Serif',serif;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.5;color:#1B4332;margin:0 0 18px\">&ldquo;What challenged me most was the idea that the international order is not something we simply have to accept. We can question whose interests it serves \u2014 and imagine something fairer together.&rdquo;</p><p style=\"font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:.86rem;color:#6E7468;margin:0\"><b style=\"color:#1B4332\">Conference participant</b></p>",
